{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_plan", "label": "Spec: remaining debts plan 2026-08-14", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_pr_566", "label": "PR #566: docs hygiene + three waves", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "\u041a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0435\u043a\u0441\u0442", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Branch chore/docs-hygiene-2026-08-08, open since 08-08; carries the local-gates fix, EN backend catalog, and business-date localdate waves; to be merged right after CI revives."}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_local_gates_mirror_ci", "label": "Wave: local make gates = mirror of CI", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "\u041a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0435\u043a\u0441\u0442 \u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Until 13-08 NOT ONE of make lint/security/i18n-check/typecheck worked: linters absent from containers, '|| true' swallowed errors, dash lacks <(...), and tsc --noEmit with solution-style tsconfig checks zero files. The same tsc hole existed in CI frontend-lint \u2014 types were never checked in CI; closed by switching to npm run lint:tsc (tsc -b)."}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_en_backend_catalog", "label": "Wave: EN backend gettext catalog fixed (38 strings)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "\u041a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0435\u043a\u0441\u0442 \u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "38 Nomenclature-wave strings: 11 empty + 27 fuzzy auto-guesses; make i18n-check green for the first time. EN terms aligned with the existing catalog (\u0437\u0430\u044f\u0432\u043a\u0430=request, \u0422\u041d \u0412\u042d\u0414=HS code, chapter/heading/subheading)."}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_business_dates_localdate", "label": "Wave: business dates \u2192 timezone.localdate()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "\u041a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0435\u043a\u0441\u0442 \u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "timezone.now().date() is the UTC date: from 00:00 to 05:00 Tashkent time the backend lived on yesterday's date (invoices, quote valid_until, subscription windows, HSCode.is_active). 25 prod call sites + 66 in tests migrated; guard core/tests/test_business_date_timezone.py verified with a planted violation."}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w0", "label": "W0: CI dead \u2014 GitHub Actions billing (owner blocker)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W0", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All PR #566 jobs fail in 2s with an EMPTY step list \u2014 runners never start; symptom identical to the 10-07\u202631-07 and 04-08 billing incidents. Not fixable from the repo; while CI is down, gates run locally and api-contract is checked manually."}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w1", "label": "W1: prod-lock vulnerabilities (cryptography 49\u219250, tablib 3.9\u21923.10)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pip-audit on the backend image env: cryptography 49.0.0 (PYSEC-2026-3552) and tablib 3.9.0 (CVE-2026-9318) \u2014 the security job will go red the moment CI revives. Floors in requirements.in already allow both fixes, so a clean lock recompile likely suffices; cryptography jumps a major \u2192 2FA/Fernet tests mandatory (TOTP secret is Fernet-encrypted). Recompile env: throwaway python:3.12 container (the runtime backend image lacks gcc \u2014 it lives in the builder stage)."}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w2", "label": "W2: bare date.today() in 4 prod sites + guard extension", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "crm/services/document_placeholders.py:88, sourcing/services_ai_extract.py:266, master_data/fx.py:39, master_data/tnved.py:124 \u2014 correct today only because Django sets process TZ as a side effect, not a contract. Move to timezone.localdate() and extend the UTC_DATE_PATTERN guard with a second pattern for date.today() in prod code (tests exempt)."}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w3", "label": "W3: config hygiene (dead .flake8, py311 black target, stale README, pytest.ini)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "backend/.flake8 is dead (lint moved to root) and lacks per-file-ignores \u2014 a silent trap when run from inside backend/; [tool.black] target-version py311 vs Python 3.12 in image and CI; deploy-staging.yml header cites a moved doc path; pytest markers need backend/pytest.ini (careful: no addopts diverging from CI)."}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w4", "label": "W4: eyes-on T2 \u2014 completeness and retired HS codes worklist", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three red tests were the ONLY witness of the 'card with a retired HS code enters the worklist' mechanic \u2014 and they lied 5 hours a day; nobody walked the live UI (cards_with_retired_codes \u2192 fill queue, hs_code completeness hint) after the fix. DoD: /ux-review scenario without dead ends, GIF/screenshot to owner (PRODUCT RULE 4)."}, {"id": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_deferred_debts", "label": "Debts consciously left out of the plan", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "\u0414\u043e\u043b\u0433\u0438, \u0441\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u041d\u0415 \u0432 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0435", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "31 eslint react-refresh warnings (not errors, bulk fix = diff noise); js-yaml dev-chain CVE fixable only via major eslint/openapi-typescript bumps (gate already --omit=dev); EN terminology open to owner point-edits (make i18n-check now holds the mechanism); staging still blocked on DNS + GitHub environment + Caddy block."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_plan", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w0", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W0", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_plan", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w1", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_plan", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w2", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_plan", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w3", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_plan", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_w4", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "W4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_plan", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_pr_566", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "\u041a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0435\u043a\u0441\u0442", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_plan", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_deferred_debts", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs/spec-remaining-debts-2026-08-14.md", "source_location": "\u0414\u043e\u043b\u0433\u0438, \u0441\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u041d\u0415 \u0432 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0435", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_pr_566", "target": "docs_dev_specs_spec_remaining_debts_2026_08_14_local_gates_mirror_ci", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Docs/dev/specs